    "path": "anthropic_claude/api_reference.json",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "text": "For the complete API reference with all endpoints, parameters, and response schemas, explore the API reference pages listed in the navigation. To access beta features, see Beta headers.\nFor details on both authentication methods and when to use each, see Authentication. All requests to the Claude API must include these headers:\n| Header | Value | Required |\n|---|---|---|\n| x-api-key | Your API key from Console | One of x-api-key orAuthorization |\n| Authorization | Bearer <token> , where<token> is a short-lived access token obtained fromPOST /v1/oauth/token through Workload Identity Federation | One of x-api-key orAuthorization |\n| anthropic-version | API version (for example, 2023-06-01 ) | Yes |\n| content-type | application/json | Yes |\nIf you are using the Client SDKs, the SDK will send these headers automatically. For API versioning details, see API versions.",
    "character_count": 874
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "1acf9586-b2ae-443d-b2c3-18b2fb83c4db",
