    "path": "anthropic_claude/release_notes.json",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "text": "- We've increased rate limits for Claude Opus 4 on the Claude API to give you more capacity to build and scale with Claude. For customers with usage tier 1-4 rate limits, these changes apply immediately to your account - no action needed.\n- We've retired the Claude 2.0, Claude 2.1, and Claude Sonnet 3 models. All requests to these models will now return an error. Read more in Model deprecations.\n- We've increased rate limits for Claude Sonnet 4 on the Claude API to give you more capacity to build and scale with Claude. For customers with usage tier 1-4 rate limits, these changes apply immediately to your account - no action needed.",
    "character_count": 639
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "471688ce-ef3d-40f0-bb4a-d12c967fc813",
    "technology": "Anthropic Claude",
    "technology_id": "source-anthropic-claude",
    "category": "llms",
