    "path": "anthropic_claude/release_notes.json",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "text": "- We've added vision support to Claude Haiku 3.5, enabling the model to analyze and understand images.\n- We've released a token-efficient tool use implementation, improving overall performance when using tools with Claude. Learn more in Tool use with Claude.\n- We've changed the default temperature in the Console for new prompts from 0 to 1 for consistency with the default temperature in the API. Existing saved prompts are unchanged.\n- We've released updated versions of our tools that decouple the text edit and bash tools from the computer use system prompt:\n- bash_20250124 : Same functionality as previous version but is independent from computer use. Does not require a beta header.\n- text_editor_20250124 : Same functionality as previous version but is independent from computer use. Does not require a beta header.",
    "character_count": 824
  },
