    "chunk_index": 57,
    "text": "- text_editor_20250124 : Same functionality as previous version but is independent from computer use. Does not require a beta header.\n- computer_20250124 : Updated computer use tool with new command options including \"hold_key\", \"left_mouse_down\", \"left_mouse_up\", \"scroll\", \"triple_click\", and \"wait\". This tool requires the \"computer-use-2025-01-24\" anthropic-beta header.\nLearn more in Tool use with Claude.\n- We've added the anthropic-organization-id response header to all API responses. This header provides the organization ID associated with the API key used in the request.\n- We've moved our Java SDK from alpha to beta.\n- We've launched citations capability in the API, allowing Claude to provide source attribution for information. Learn more in Citations.\n- We've added support for plain text documents and custom content documents in the Messages API.\n- We announced the deprecation of the Claude 2, Claude 2.1, and Claude Sonnet 3 models. Read more in Model deprecations.",
    "character_count": 985
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "4dfca79b-34a5-4ab0-b6d8-d148fd9ea24c",
    "technology": "Anthropic Claude",
    "technology_id": "source-anthropic-claude",
