    "path": "anthropic_claude/release_notes.json",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "text": "- We've added Anthropic-defined computer use tools to our API for use with the new Claude Sonnet 3.5. Read more in Computer use tool.\n- Claude Sonnet 3.5, our most intelligent model yet, just got an upgrade and is now available on the Claude API. Read more in the Claude Sonnet documentation.\n- The Message Batches API is now available in beta. Process large batches of queries asynchronously in the Claude API for 50% less cost. Read more in Batch processing.\n- We've loosened restrictions on the ordering of user /assistant turns in our Messages API. Consecutiveuser /assistant messages will be combined into a single message instead of erroring, and we no longer require the first input message to be auser message.\n- We've deprecated the Build and Scale plans in favor of a standard feature suite (formerly referred to as Build), along with additional features that are available through sales. Read more in our API pricing information.",
    "character_count": 940
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "5a566cbc-5f74-4d4a-8497-1e6daeccb7fa",
    "technology": "Anthropic Claude",
    "technology_id": "source-anthropic-claude",
