    "text": "Newsroom\n- Press inquirespress@anthropic.com\n- Non-media inquiriesHow to get support\n- Media assetsDownload press kit\nInviting hard questions\nWe’re asking the public for their hardest questions about AI, and committing to show our work as we address them.\nThe Making of Claude Code\nThe inside story of how Claude Code went from an internal CLI to Anthropic's coding agent, told by researchers, engineers and early users who built it.\nRedeploying Fable 5\nFable 5 returns globally July 1. We're also proposing an industry-wide framework for scoring jailbreak severity, together with Amazon, Microsoft, Google, and other Glasswing partners.\nIntroducing Claude Sonnet 5\nSonnet 5 delivers frontier performance across coding, agents, and professional work at scale.",
