    "text": "- 2025/03: (Beta) Fine-tuning Multimodal models is now supported in Axolotl. Check out the docs to fine-tune your own!\n- 2025/02: Axolotl has added LoRA optimizations to reduce memory usage and improve training speed for LoRA and QLoRA in single GPU and multi-GPU training (DDP and DeepSpeed). Jump into the docs to give it a try.\n- 2025/02: Axolotl has added GRPO support. Dive into our blog and GRPO example and have some fun!\n- 2025/01: Axolotl has added Reward Modelling / Process Reward Modelling fine-tuning support. See docs.\nAxolotl is a free and open-source tool designed to streamline post-training and fine-tuning for the latest large language models (LLMs).\nFeatures:\n- Multiple Model Support: Train various models like GPT-OSS, LLaMA, Mistral, Mixtral, Pythia, and many more models available on the Hugging Face Hub.",
    "character_count": 829
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "e56000e3-9e53-45e6-bff9-7bce8fb1b6e8",
    "technology": "Axolotl",
    "technology_id": "source-axolotl",
    "category": "fine_tuning",
    "organization": "Axolotl",
    "license": "Apache-2.0",
    "priority": "high",
    "update_frequency": "weekly",
    "source": "github_repository",
    "url": "https://github.com/axolotl-ai-cloud/axolotl",
    "path": "axolotl/github_repository.json",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "text": "Features:\n- Multiple Model Support: Train various models like GPT-OSS, LLaMA, Mistral, Mixtral, Pythia, and many more models available on the Hugging Face Hub.\n- Multimodal Training: Fine-tune vision-language models (VLMs) including LLaMA-Vision, Qwen2-VL, Pixtral, LLaVA, SmolVLM2, GLM-4.6V, InternVL 3.5, Gemma 3n, PaddleOCR-VL, and audio models like Voxtral with image, video, and audio support.\n- Training Methods: Full fine-tuning, LoRA, QLoRA, GPTQ, QAT (int8/int4/FP8/NVFP4/MXFP4), FP8 mixed-precision training, NVFP4/MXFP4 MoE LoRA, Preference Tuning (DPO, IPO, KTO, ORPO), RL (GRPO, GDPO), and Reward Modelling (RM) / Process Reward Modelling (PRM).\n- Easy Configuration: Re-use a single YAML configuration file across the full fine-tuning pipeline: dataset preprocessing, training, evaluation, quantization, and inference.",
    "character_count": 832
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "9a0daae5-ec6c-49fc-9e1e-ebab709f8224",
    "technology": "Axolotl",
    "technology_id": "source-axolotl",
