    "path": "bentoml/official_documentation.json",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "text": "BentoML Documentation¶\nBentoML is a Unified Inference Platform for deploying and scaling AI systems with any model, on any cloud.\nFeatured examples¶\nServe large language models with OpenAI-compatible APIs and vLLM inference backend.\nDeploy private RAG systems with open-source embedding and large language models.\nDeploy image generation APIs with flexible customization and optimized batch processing.\nAutomate reproducible workflows with queued execution using ComfyUI pipelines.\nBuild a phone calling agent with end-to-end streaming capabilities using open-source models and Twilio.\nProtect your LLM API endpoint from harmful input using Google’s safety content moderation model.\nExplore what developers are building with BentoML.\nWhat is BentoML¶",
    "character_count": 750
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "433a890f-fb04-47ea-bef8-ebf08a289899",
    "technology": "BentoML",
    "technology_id": "source-bentoml",
    "category": "deployment",
    "organization": "BentoML",
    "license": "Apache-2.0",
    "priority": "high",
    "update_frequency": "weekly",
    "source": "official_documentation",
    "url": "https://docs.bentoml.org/en/latest/",
    "path": "bentoml/official_documentation.json",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "text": "Protect your LLM API endpoint from harmful input using Google’s safety content moderation model.\nExplore what developers are building with BentoML.\nWhat is BentoML¶\nBentoML is a Unified Inference Platform for deploying and scaling AI models with production-grade reliability, all without the complexity of managing infrastructure. It enables your developers to build AI systems 10x faster with custom models, scale efficiently in your cloud, and maintain complete control over security and compliance.\nTo get started with BentoML:\n- Use pip to install the BentoML open-source model serving framework, which is distributed as a Python package on PyPI. # Recommend Python 3.9+ pip install bentoml\n- Sign up for BentoCloud to get a free trial.\nHow-tos¶\nBuild your custom AI APIs with BentoML.\nDeploy your AI application to production with one command.\nConfigure fast autoscaling to achieve optimal performance.\nRun model inference on GPUs with BentoML.",
    "character_count": 949
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "8e5eb50e-d36b-436b-807d-9abc286bf14a",
    "technology": "BentoML",
    "technology_id": "source-bentoml",
    "category": "deployment",
    "organization": "BentoML",
