    "source": "github_repository",
    "url": "https://github.com/HuskyInSalt/CRAG",
    "path": "crag/github_repository.json",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "text": "--model_path YOUR_EVALUATOR_PATH \\\n--input_queries ../data/$dataset/sources \\\n--input_retrieval ../data/$dataset/retrieved_psgs \\\n--decompose_mode selection \\\n--output_file ../data/$dataset/ref/correct\nQuestion rewriting and web searching are proposed here, thus an openai_api_key and a search_key are required.\nIn this experiment, we utilized a third-party Google Search API platform for searching.\nTwo selective modes including wiki and all are available.\nwiki visits pages related to Wikipedia preferentially, while all visit all pages equally.\npython external_knowledge_preparation.py \\\n--model_path YOUR_EVALUATOR_PATH \\\n--input_queries ../data/$dataset/sources \\\n--openai_key $OPENAI_KEY \\\n--search_key $SEARCH_KEY \\\n--task $dataset --mode wiki\\\n--output_file ../data/$dataset/ref/incorrect\nRun the following command to combine both correct and incorrect knowledge for ambiguous action.\npython combined_knowledge_preparation.py \\\n--correct_path ../data/$dataset/ref/correct \\",
    "character_count": 981
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "832adb94-5579-441a-995e-a77105c17449",
    "technology": "CRAG",
    "technology_id": "source-crag",
    "category": "retrieval",
