    "text": "Computer Science > Computation and Language\n[Submitted on 28 Jan 2022 (v1), last revised 10 Jan 2023 (this version, v6)]\nTitle:Chain-of-Thought Prompting Elicits Reasoning in Large Language Models\nView PDF",
