    "url": "https://docs.trychroma.com/cloud/sync/overview#reference",
    "path": "chroma/api_reference.json",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "text": "- database_name is the Chroma database in which collections will be created. The database must already exist.\n- embedding.dense.model is the dense embedding model. Currently onlyQwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B is supported. Reach out to engineering@trychroma.com to request additional models.\n- embedding.sparse.model —Chroma/BM25 orprithivida/Splade_PP_en_v1 .\n- embedding.sparse.key — metadata key under which sparse embeddings are stored.\n- chunking.type —tree_sitter (syntax-aware, withmax_size_bytes ) orlines (line-based, withmax_lines andmax_size_bytes ).\nGlobal Invocation Configuration\nEach invocation may specify a target collection:",
    "character_count": 637
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "78b7917a-ab2f-4773-9395-8223560a2838",
    "technology": "Chroma",
