    "path": "google_cloud_run/official_documentation.json",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "text": "Run LLM inference on Cloud Run GPUs with Gemma 3 and Ollama\nLearn how to deploy Google's Gemma 3 on a GPU-enabled Cloud Run service.\nHello Cloud Run\nThe goal of this lab is for you to build a container image and deploying it to Cloud Run. In this lab, you'll learn how to get started with Cloud Run by deploying and running a stateless container.\nBuild a Resilient, Asynchronous System with Cloud Run and Pub/Sub\nFor the labs in the Google Cloud Run Serverless Quest, you will read through a fictitious business scenario in each lab and assist the characters in implementing a serverless solution.\nWeb services: REST APIs backend",
    "character_count": 629
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "02f4f422-2ff8-4807-abc2-153ae7ca1bbb",
    "technology": "Google Cloud Run",
    "technology_id": "source-google-cloud-run",
    "category": "deployment",
    "organization": "Google",
    "license": "",
    "priority": "high",
    "update_frequency": "weekly",
    "source": "official_documentation",
    "url": "https://cloud.google.com/run/docs",
    "path": "google_cloud_run/official_documentation.json",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "text": "Web services: REST APIs backend\nModern mobile apps commonly rely on RESTful backend APIs to provide current views of application data and separation for frontend and backend development teams. API services running on Cloud Run allow developers to persist data reliably on managed databases such as Cloud SQL or Firestore (NoSQL). Logging in to Cloud Run grants users access to app‐resource data stored in Cloud Databases.\nWeb services: Back‐office administration\nBack‐office administration often requires documents, spreadsheets, and other custom integrations, and running a vendor‐supplied web application. Hosting the containerized internal web application on Cloud Run means it is always ready and you are only billed when it is used.\nData processing: Lightweight data transformation",
    "character_count": 786
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "e36e332e-2840-4a90-9f2d-3fe5244b0789",
    "technology": "Google Cloud Run",
