    "text": "June 26, 2025.\nMay 27, 2025\n- The last available tuning model, Gemini 1.5 Flash 001, has been shut down. Tuning is no longer supported on any models. See Fine tuning with the Gemini API.\nMay 20, 2025\nAPI updates:\n- Launched support for custom video preprocessing using clipping intervals and configurable frame rate sampling.\n- Launched multi-tool use, which supports configuring\ncode execution and\nGrounding with Google Search on the same\ngenerateContent request.\n- Launched support for asynchronous function calls in the Live API.\n- Launched an experimental URL context tool for providing URLs as additional context to prompts.\nModel updates:\n- Released gemini-2.5-flash-preview-05-20 , a Gemini\npreview model optimized for\nprice-performance and adaptive thinking. To learn more, see\nGemini 2.5 Flash Preview\nand Thinking.\n- Released the\ngemini-2.5-pro-preview-tts andgemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts models, which are capable of\ngenerating speech with one or two\nspeakers.",
