    "text": "Computer Science > Computation and Language\n[Submitted on 19 Dec 2023 (v1), last revised 9 May 2025 (this version, v5)]\nTitle:Gemini: A Family of Highly Capable Multimodal Models\nView PDF",
    "character_count": 187
