    "text": "Computer Science > Computation and Language\n[Submitted on 18 Aug 2023 (v1), last revised 6 Feb 2024 (this version, v4)]\nTitle:Graph of Thoughts: Solving Elaborate Problems with Large Language Models\nView PDF",
    "character_count": 207
