    "chunk_index": 0,
    "text": "Computer Science > Computation and Language\n[Submitted on 24 Apr 2024 (v1), last revised 19 Feb 2025 (this version, v2)]\nTitle:From Local to Global: A Graph RAG Approach to Query-Focused Summarization\nView PDF HTML (experimental)",
    "character_count": 229
