    "text": "Haystack lets you go from a proof-of-concept to a full production system with unified tooling for building, testing, and shipping your AI use cases.\nOperate at Enterprise Scale\nRun production workloads across any environment with built-in reliability and observability.\nHaystack Pipelines are serializable, cloud-agnostic, and Kubernetes-ready, with logging, monitoring, and deployment guides to support you.\nBuild and Scale with the Haystack Ecosystem\nFrom open source to enterprise: tools for every step of your AI journey\nHaystack, AI Orchestration Framework\nEnterprise Support\nEnterprise-support for the Haystack framework, with exclusive access to:\n- Private, secure engineering support\n- Best practices templates & deployment guides\n- Access to flexible services\n- Flexible pricing based on company size\nHaystack Use Cases\nJoin the community\nJoin our Discord\nOur community on Discord is for everyone interested in NLP, using Haystack or even just getting started!\nGET STARTED",
