    "technology": "LoRA",
    "technology_id": "source-lora",
    "category": "fine_tuning",
    "organization": "Independent Research",
    "license": "MIT",
    "priority": "high",
    "update_frequency": "weekly",
    "source": "github_repository",
    "url": "https://github.com/microsoft/LoRA",
    "path": "lora/github_repository.json",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "text": "| | | RoBERTa base Fine-tune | RoBERTa base LoRA | DeBERTa XXL Fine-tune | DeBERTa XXL LoRA |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| | # of Trainable Params. | 125M | 0.8M | 1.5B | 4.7M |\n| | MNLI (m-Acc/mm-Acc) | 87.6 | 87.5±.3/86.9±.3 | 91.7/91.9 | 91.9±.1/91.9±.2 |\n| | SST2 (Acc) | 94.8 | 95.1±.2 | 97.2 | 96.9±.2 |\n| | MRPC (Acc) | 90.2 | 89.7±.7 | 92.0 | 92.6±.6 |\n| | CoLA (Matthew's Corr) | 63.6 | 63.4±1.2 | 72.0 | 72.4±1.1 |\n| | QNLI (Acc) | 92.8 | 93.3±.3 | 96.0 | 96.0±.1 |\n| | QQP (Acc) | 91.9 | 90.8±.1 | 92.7 | 92.9±.1 |\n| | RTE (Acc) | 78.7 | 86.6±.7 | 93.9 | 94.9±.4 |\n| | STSB (Pearson/Spearman Corr) | 91.2 | 91.5±.2/91.3±.2 | 92.9/92.6 | 93.0±.2/92.9±.3 |\n| | Average | 86.40 | 87.24 | 91.06 | 91.32 |\nNote: You still need the original pre-trained checkpoint from Hugging Face to use the LoRA checkpoints.",
    "character_count": 814
  },
