    "text": "Computer Science > Computation and Language\n[Submitted on 17 Jun 2021 (v1), last revised 16 Oct 2021 (this version, v2)]\nTitle:LoRA: Low-Rank Adaptation of Large Language Models\nView PDF HTML (experimental)",
    "character_count": 206
