    "path": "meta_llama/github_repository.json",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "text": "- Visit one of the repos, for example meta-llama/Llama-4-Scout-17B-16E.\n- Read and accept the license. Once your request is approved, you'll be granted access to all Llama 3.1 models as well as previous versions. Note that requests used to take up to one hour to get processed.\n- To download the original native weights to use with this repo, click on the \"Files and versions\" tab and download the contents of the original folder. You can also download them from the command line if youpip install huggingface-hub :\nhuggingface-cli download meta-llama/Llama-4-Scout-17B-16E-Instruct-Original --local-dir meta-llama/Llama-4-Scout-17B-16E-Instruct-Original\n-",
    "character_count": 656
