    "path": "meta_llama/github_repository.json",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "text": "huggingface-cli download meta-llama/Llama-4-Scout-17B-16E-Instruct-Original --local-dir meta-llama/Llama-4-Scout-17B-16E-Instruct-Original\n-\nTo use with transformers, the following snippet will download and cache the weights: # inference.py from transformers import AutoTokenizer, Llama4ForConditionalGeneration import torch model_id = \"meta-llama/Llama-4-Scout-17B-16E-Instruct\" tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_id) messages = [ {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Who are you?\"}, ] inputs = tokenizer.apply_chat_template( messages, add_generation_prompt=True, return_tensors=\"pt\", return_dict=True ) model = Llama4ForConditionalGeneration.from_pretrained( model_id, device_map=\"auto\", torch_dtype=torch.bfloat16 ) outputs = model.generate(**inputs.to(model.device), max_new_tokens=100) outputs = tokenizer.batch_decode(outputs[:, inputs[\"input_ids\"].shape[-1] :]) print(outputs[0]) torchrun --nnodes=1 --nproc_per_node=8 inference.py",
    "character_count": 943
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "37c069f6-7deb-4009-8a07-9275831c8e5c",
    "technology": "Meta Llama",
    "technology_id": "source-meta-llama",
    "category": "llms",
    "organization": "Meta",
    "license": "Llama 3 Community License",
    "priority": "high",
    "update_frequency": "weekly",
    "source": "github_repository",
    "url": "https://github.com/meta-llama/llama-models",
    "path": "meta_llama/github_repository.json",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "text": "You can install this repository as a package by just doing pip install llama-models\nLlama models are a new technology that carries potential risks with use. Testing conducted to date has not — and could not — cover all scenarios. To help developers address these risks, we have created the Responsible Use Guide.\nPlease report any software “bug” or other problems with the models through one of the following means:\n- Reporting issues with the model: https://github.com/meta-llama/llama-models/issues\n- Reporting risky content generated by the model: developers.facebook.com/llama_output_feedback\n- Reporting bugs and security concerns: facebook.com/whitehat/info\nFor common questions, the FAQ can be found here, which will be updated over time as new questions arise.",
    "character_count": 768
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "a976fc32-b3b7-4b2b-83c2-9dcdc34b2d28",
    "technology": "Meta Llama",
    "technology_id": "source-meta-llama",
    "category": "llms",
    "organization": "Meta",
    "license": "Llama 3 Community License",
