    "text": "Mistral AI Documentation\nAll our documentation in your hands: build, customize, and deploy AI, your way.\nDiscover our platform\nThree products, one platform. Pick where you want to start.\nVibe\nThe unified agent for productivity and coding. Chat with it on the web or mobile, or run it in your terminal and editor.\nStudio\nThe developer console and the Mistral API. Keys, the Playground, evaluations, agents, and SDKs to ship applications.\nAdmin\nThe control plane for organization setup, billing, SSO, Workspaces, and access policies.\nLatest models\nMistral Medium 3.5\nOur frontier-class multimodal model optimized for agentic and coding use cases.\nMistral Small 4\nHybrid model unifying instruct, reasoning, and coding in a single efficient model.\nVoxtral Mini Transcribe Realtime\nAn efficient audio input model, pre-trained and optimized for live transcription purposes.\nVoxtral TTS\nState-of-the-art TTS with zero-shot voice cloning and multilingual support.\nOCR 4",
