    "path": "openai_gpt/release_notes.json",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "text": "Released GPT-5.1, the newest flagship model in the GPT-5 model family. GPT-5.1 is trained to be especially proficient in:\n- Steerability and faster responses when less thinking's required\n- Code generation and coding use cases\n- Agentic workflows\nNote that GPT-5.1 defaults to a new none reasoning setting for faster responses when less thinking's required—different from the previous medium default setting in GPT-5.\nReleased enhanced role-based access controls (RBAC). Role-based access control (RBAC) lets you decide who can do what across your organization and projects—both through the API and in the Dashboard.\nReleased gpt-5.1-codex and gpt-5.1-codex-mini to the Responses API. GPT-5.1-Codex is a version of GPT-5.1 optimized for agentic coding tasks in Codex or similar environments. Read more here.",
    "character_count": 807
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "dcafb2e8-c521-4c9e-9b52-9701933d1c18",
