    "path": "openai_gpt/release_notes.json",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "text": "Added fine-tuning support with direct preference optimization for the models gpt-4.1-2025-04-14, gpt-4.1-mini-2025-04-14, and gpt-4.1-nano-2025-04-14.\nNew model snapshots available for gpt-4o-audio-preview and gpt-4o-realtime-preview. Released Agents SDK for TypeScript.\nMay, 2025\nAdded support for new built-in tools in the Responses API, including remote MCP servers and code interpreter. Learn more about tools.\nAdded support for using strict mode for tool schemas when using parallel tool calling with non-fine-tuned models.\nAdded new schema features, including string validation for email and other patterns and specifying ranges for numbers and arrays.\nLaunched codex-mini-latest in the API, optimized for use with the Codex CLI.\nLaunched support for reinforcement fine-tuning. Learn about available fine-tuning methods. gpt-4.1-nano is now available for fine-tuning.\nApril, 2025\nLaunched support for Enhanced API Budget Alerts & Auto-recharge Limits.",
    "character_count": 957
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "efd71a52-19fd-46de-9a4c-6a81679815cf",
    "technology": "OpenAI GPT",
    "technology_id": "source-openai-gpt",
    "category": "llms",
