    "text": "get_root_nodes #\nGet root nodes.\nSource code in llama-index-core/llama_index/core/node_parser/relational/hierarchical.py\n| 34 35 36 37 38 39 40 | def get_root_nodes(nodes: List[BaseNode]) -> List[BaseNode]: \"\"\"Get root nodes.\"\"\" root_nodes = [] for node in nodes: if NodeRelationship.PARENT not in node.relationships: root_nodes.append(node) return root_nodes |\nget_child_nodes #\nGet child nodes of nodes from given all_nodes.\nSource code in llama-index-core/llama_index/core/node_parser/relational/hierarchical.py",
