    "text": "💜 Qwen Chat   |   🤗 Hugging Face   |   🤖 ModelScope   |    📑 Paper    |    📑 Blog    ｜   📖 Documentation\n🖥️ Demo   |   💬 WeChat (微信)   |   🫨 Discord  \nVisit our Hugging Face or ModelScope organization (click links above), search checkpoints with names starting with Qwen3- or visit the Qwen3 collection, and you will find all you need! Enjoy!\nTo learn more about Qwen3, feel free to read our documentation [EN|ZH]. Our documentation consists of the following sections:\n- Quickstart: the basic usages and demonstrations;\n- Inference: the guidance for the inference with Transformers, including batch inference, streaming, etc.;\n- Run Locally: the instructions for running LLM locally on CPU and GPU, with frameworks like llama.cpp, Ollama, and LM Studio;\n- Deployment: the demonstration of how to deploy Qwen for large-scale inference with frameworks like SGLang, vLLM, TGI, etc.;",
    "character_count": 879
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "7f3a42c6-c635-41a9-ac7d-4de1c2ac1ec5",
    "technology": "Qwen",
    "technology_id": "source-qwen",
