    "path": "self_rag/github_repository.json",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "text": "For ASQA, please run the following command,\npython run_long_form_static.py \\\n--model_name selfrag/selfrag_llama2_7b \\\n--ndocs 5 --max_new_tokens 300 --threshold 0.2 \\\n--use_grounding --use_utility --use_seqscore \\\n--task asqa --input_file eval_data/asqa_eval_gtr_top100.json \\\n--output_file YOUR_OUTPUT_FILE_NAME --max_depth 7 --mode always_retrieve \\\nFor FactScore,\npython run_long_form_static.py \\\n--model_name selfrag/selfrag_llama2_7b \\\n--ndocs 5 --max_new_tokens 300 --threshold 0.2 \\\n--use_grounding --use_utility --use_seqscore \\\n--task factscore --input_file eval_data/factscore_unlabeled_alpaca_13b_retrieval.jsonl \\\n--output_file YOUR_OUTPUT_FILE_NAME --max_depth 7 \\\nThere are several key parameters related to the inference of Self-RAG.\n- w_rel (default 1.0):w_rel controls the emphasis on theisRel (a critique token on whether retrieved passages are relevant or not) token probability during beam search.",
    "character_count": 917
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "1eb8b1cc-353a-4d41-973f-b84d87ccc984",
    "technology": "SELF-RAG",
    "technology_id": "source-self-rag",
    "category": "retrieval",
