    "chunk_index": 17,
    "text": "corpus_embeddings = model.encode(corpus, prompt=corpus_instruction)\nsimilarities = cos_sim(query_embedding, corpus_embeddings)\nprint(similarities)\n# => tensor([[0.8835, 0.7037, 0.6970]])\nAll other Instructor models either 1) will not load as they refer to InstructorEmbedding in their modules.json or 2) require calling model.set_pooling_include_prompt(include_prompt=False) after loading.\nScientific Similarity Models\nSPECTER is a model trained on scientific citations and can be used to estimate the similarity of two publications. We can use it to find similar papers.",
    "character_count": 571
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "b775cd70-0fad-4099-afe3-ba06f069aadc",
    "technology": "Sentence Transformers",
    "technology_id": "source-sentence-transformers",
    "category": "embeddings",
    "organization": "UKPLab",
