    "chunk_index": 2,
    "text": "Walmart Global Tech, Cisco, J.P. Morgan Chase, Equinix, VMware by Broadcom, Hitachi Digital Services, Thomson Reuters, phData, HID Global and others. See ADOPTERS.md.\nInstall the trulens pip package from PyPI.\npip install trulens\nInstall with a specific LLM provider for feedback evaluation:\npip install trulens trulens-providers-openai # OpenAI / Azure OpenAI\npip install trulens trulens-providers-litellm # LiteLLM (Anthropic, Cohere, Mistral, …)\npip install trulens trulens-providers-google # Google Gemini\npip install trulens trulens-providers-bedrock # AWS Bedrock\npip install trulens trulens-providers-cortex # Snowflake Cortex\npip install trulens trulens-providers-huggingface # HuggingFace\npip install trulens trulens-providers-langchain # LangChain models\nInstall with a specific app framework integration:\npip install trulens trulens-apps-langchain # LangChain / LangGraph\npip install trulens trulens-apps-llamaindex # LlamaIndex",
    "character_count": 939
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "0fbf5e24-b4d1-440e-b432-4d5253244a8e",
    "technology": "TruLens",
    "technology_id": "source-trulens",
    "category": "evaluation",
    "organization": "TruEra",
    "license": "MIT",
    "priority": "high",
    "update_frequency": "weekly",
