    "path": "unsloth/official_documentation.json",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "text": "Use the same command to update.\nTo force the Vulkan llama.cpp backend, set the environment variable before running the installer or updater:\n$env:UNSLOTH_FORCE_VULKAN=1\nirm https://unsloth.ai/install.ps1 | iex\nRe-running the current installer replaces a previously selected CPU bundle when the backend differs. A separate Vulkan SDK is not required; the GPU driver must provide a working Vulkan runtime.\nunsloth studio -p 8888\nFor LAN or cloud access, add -H 0.0.0.0 (raw port only; add --cloudflare for a public URL). By default, Unsloth is accessible only locally.",
    "character_count": 566
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "fd2031aa-1ba6-495c-b0e3-8cdb30863cf8",
    "technology": "Unsloth",
    "technology_id": "source-unsloth",
