    "chunk_index": 8,
    "text": "Train for free with our notebooks. You can use our new free Unsloth Studio notebook to run and train models for free in a web UI. Read our guide. Add dataset, run, then deploy your trained model.\n| Model | Free Notebooks | Performance | Memory use |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Gemma 4 (E2B) | | 1.5x faster | 50% less |\n| Qwen3.5 (4B) | | 1.5x faster | 60% less |\n| gpt-oss (20B) | | 2x faster | 70% less |\n| Qwen3.5 GSPO | | 2x faster | 70% less |\n| gpt-oss (20B): GRPO | | 2x faster | 80% less |\n| Qwen3: Advanced GRPO | | 2x faster | 70% less |\n| embeddinggemma (300M) | | 2x faster | 20% less |\n| Mistral Ministral 3 (3B) | | 1.5x faster | 60% less |\n| Llama 3.1 (8B) Alpaca | | 2x faster | 70% less |\n| Llama 3.2 Conversational | | 2x faster | 70% less |\n| Orpheus-TTS (3B) | | 1.5x faster | 50% less |\n- See all our notebooks for: Kaggle, GRPO, TTS, embedding & Vision\n- See all our models and all our notebooks\n- See detailed documentation for Unsloth here",
