    "path": "weaviate/benchmark_pages.json",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "text": "Benchmarks\nYou can find the following vector database performance benchmarks:\n- ANN (unfiltered vector search) latencies and throughput\n- Filtered ANN (benchmark coming soon)\n- Scalar filters / Inverted Index (benchmark coming soon)\n- Large-scale ANN (benchmark coming soon)\nBenchmark code\nThe code for the benchmarks can be found in this GitHub repo.",
    "character_count": 351
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "3b5e9bae-f787-434b-a3ac-68eeb409ff52",
    "technology": "Weaviate",
    "technology_id": "source-weaviate",
    "category": "vectordbs",
