    "path": "weaviate/community_resources.json",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "text": "Hi everyone ! We have a small (but exciting!) community update to share!\nWe’ll be saying goodbye to our public Slack and officially moving the conversation here.\nBefore you panic — this is actually a glow-up\nWhile Slack has been a great place to connect, there’s one big downside: conversations slowly disappear and aren’t searchable in the long term.\nThat means valuable answers, insights, and “aha!” ! moments get lost over time. And we think the knowledge we create as a community deserves better.\nOur forum is built to be a lasting, searchable home for all those great discussions.\n- Better indexing.\n- Better discoverability.\n- Better for future-you (and everyone else who runs into the same question six months from now).\nThink of it as moving from a busy group chat to a cozy, well-organized library… that still feels like a living room.\nWe’d absolutely love for you to keep the conversation going there — start threads, share ideas, ask questions, and help others.",
    "character_count": 972
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "d7d16563-f343-4852-b7ff-689c45c7a1dc",
    "technology": "Weaviate",
    "technology_id": "source-weaviate",
    "category": "vectordbs",
    "organization": "Weaviate",
    "license": "BSD-3-Clause",
    "priority": "high",
    "update_frequency": "weekly",
    "source": "community_resources",
    "url": "https://weaviate.io/slack",
    "path": "weaviate/community_resources.json",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "text": "We’d absolutely love for you to keep the conversation going there — start threads, share ideas, ask questions, and help others.\nThe community isn’t changing — and neither is the forum — we’re just making it our main address.\nAnd if you ever have a question you’d rather not ask in public, no worries at all.\nYou can always reach us directly at support@weaviate.io. We’re here for you.\nThanks for being part of this community!\nWe’re really excited about what’s ahead — and we can’t wait to build it together with you!\nSee you around\nThe Weaviate Team",
    "character_count": 549
  },
