    "path": "weights_biases/github_repository.json",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "text": "Use W&B to build better models faster. Track and visualize all the pieces of your machine learning pipeline, from datasets to production machine learning models. Get started with W&B today, sign up for a W&B account!\nBuilding an LLM app? Track, debug, evaluate, and monitor LLM apps with Weave, our new suite of tools for GenAI.\nSee the W&B Developer Guide and API Reference Guide for a full technical description of the W&B platform.\nInstall W&B to track, visualize, and manage machine learning experiments of any size.\npip install wandb\nSign up for a W&B account. Create a new API key at wandb.ai/settings and store it securely. Optionally, use the wandb login CLI to configure your API key on your machine. You can skip this step -- W&B will prompt you to create an API key the first time you use it.\nNote: API keys can only be viewed once when created. Store your API key in a secure location like a password manager or environment variable.",
    "character_count": 945
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "672d1aec-3801-4a03-aab7-51a663546be9",
